# Citation metadata, in the format GitHub and Zenodo both read.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Molarity Converter for Biologics
abstract: >-
  A deterministic browser tool that converts between mass and molar
  concentration for a protein whose molecular weight the user declares,
  along with its source and what that weight is the mass of. No molecular
  weight is supplied, inferred, defaulted or looked up, and no data entered
  into the converter leaves the browser.
